 "description": "The Net Zero Loan Program offers financing to Maryland homeowners for constructing energy efficient homes.",
 "main_html": "<main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div>\n<div id=\"block-maryland-hero\">\n<section aria-labelledby=\"node-64-title\" class=\"maryland-hero maryland-hero--basic has-illustration no-image\">\n<div class=\"maryland-hero__container\">\n<div class=\"maryland-hero__content\">\n<div class=\"maryland-hero__breadcrumb\">\n<div class=\"maryland-breadcrumb__wrapper maryland-breadcrumb__wrapper--dark\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumbs\" class=\"usa-breadcrumb maryland-breadcrumb maryland-breadcrumb--dark\">\n<ol class=\"usa-breadcrumb__list maryland-breadcrumb__list\">\n<li class=\"usa-breadcrumb__list-item maryland-breadcrumb__list-item\">\n<a class=\"usa-breadcrumb__link maryland-breadcrumb__link\" href=\"/\">\n<span>Home</span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"usa-breadcrumb__list-item maryland-breadcrumb__list-item\">\n<a class=\"usa-breadcrumb__link maryland-breadcrumb__link\" href=\"/energy-home-repair\">\n<span>Energy &amp; Home Repair</span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"usa-breadcrumb__list-item maryland-breadcrumb__list-item\">\n<a class=\"usa-breadcrumb__link maryland-breadcrumb__link\" href=\"/energy-home-repair/energy-grants-and-loans-residents\">\n<span>Energy Grants and Loans for Residents</span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li aria-current=\"page\" class=\"usa-breadcrumb__list-item maryland-breadcrumb__list-item usa-current\">\n<span class=\"usa-breadcrumb__link maryland-breadcrumb__link\">\n<span>Net Zero Loan Program</span>\n</span>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h1 class=\"maryland-hero__title\" id=\"node-64-title\"><span>Net Zero Loan Program</span>\n</h1>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hidden\" data-drupal-messages-fallback=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid-container\">\n<div class=\"maryland-page-alerts margin-top-6\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"views-element-container\" id=\"block-maryland-views-block-local-alerts-site-wide\">\n<div><div class=\"js-view-dom-id-b11efaeefafd08f9156ca9f12db33bc426fab9bbdbe9cebeff17f24feaaad454\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"views-element-container\" id=\"block-maryland-views-block-local-alerts-page-specific\">\n<div><div class=\"js-view-dom-id-90a70d1138ab66e3248ae7b7b9a9e2aeb305fe7c363ae7f05e042fa6f2a9e4bb\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid-container\">\n<div class=\"grid-row grid-gap\">\n<aside class=\"layout-sidebar-first grid-col-12 desktop:grid-col-3 margin-top-8 desktop:margin-top-10 desktop:margin-bottom-15\" role=\"complementary\">\n<a class=\"usa-skipnav maryland-link maryland-link--skipnav\" href=\"#page-content\">Skip sidebar navigation</a>\n<nav aria-labelledby=\"sidenav-title\" class=\"maryland-sidenav\">\n<button aria-controls=\"sidenav\" class=\"maryland-sidenav__toggle\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"usa-sr-only\">Close</span>\n<h2 class=\"maryland-sidenav__title\" id=\"sidenav-title\">Section Menu</h2>\n</button>\n<ul class=\"maryland-sidenav__list maryland-sidenav__list--level-1\" data-region=\"sidebar_first\" id=\"sidenav\">\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-1\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-1\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/760\" href=\"/energy-home-repair/energy-grants-and-loans-residents\">Energy Grants and Loans for Residents</a>\n<ul class=\"maryland-sidenav__list maryland-sidenav__list--level-2\" data-region=\"sidebar_first\">\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/60\" href=\"/energy-home-repair/energy-grants-and-loans-residents/empower\">EmPOWER</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/62\" href=\"/energy-home-repair/energy-grants-and-loans-residents/maryland-energy-assistance-program\">Maryland Energy Assistance Program</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/61\" href=\"/energy-home-repair/energy-grants-and-loans-residents/weatherization-assistance-program-wap\">Weatherization Assistance Program (WAP)</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/63\" href=\"/energy-home-repair/energy-grants-and-loans-residents/besmart-home-loan-program\">BeSMART Home Loan Program</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<span aria-current=\"page\" class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\">Net Zero Loan Program</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"margin-y-8 desktop:margin-top-10 desktop:margin-bottom-15 grid-col-12 desktop:grid-col-8\" id=\"page-content\">\n<div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"summary-box\" class=\"maryland-summary-box\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"maryland-summary-box__inner\">\n<h2 class=\"maryland-summary-box__heading\" id=\"summary-box\">\n          Application\n        </h2>\n<div class=\"maryland-summary-box__text\">\n<ul class=\"maryland-summary-box__list\">\n<li><p><strong>Application status:</strong> Open</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Application opened:</strong> April 16, 2025</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Application closes:</strong> We are accepting applications until available funds are committed.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"usa-prose maryland-toc-target\">\n<div class=\"maryland-toc\">\n</div>\n<p>Net Zero homes are energy efficient homes that produce as much or more energy than they will use. </p><p>The Maryland Department of Housing and Community Development supports the construction of Net Zero homes throughout Maryland.​ Net Zero home features ​may include:</p><ul><li>Advanced energy efficient design and technology</li><li>Renewable energy resources</li><li>Home Energy Rating System (HERS) rating of 50 or lower</li></ul><h2>Net zero financing available</h2><ul><li>Low interest construction loan (available to builders, developers or owners building in Maryland)</li><li>Loan enhancements for private construction loan</li></ul><h2>Eligible projects</h2><ul><li>New construction or deep energy retrofits of an existing home.</li><li>Must reach low energy status with HERS (Home Energy Rating System) rating of 50 or lower.</li><li>Properly zoned for residential use.</li><li>Must be constructed or rehabilitated in accordance with the applicable Local, State and Federal building codes.</li></ul><h2>Eligible applicants</h2><p>Maryland homeowners, builders, developers, or investors who meet the following criteria:</p><ul><li>Qualified to do business in Maryland.</li><li>Have the legal capacity and all necessary authorization to incur the obligation of the loan.</li><li>Demonstrate credit worthiness and repayment ability acceptable to the department.</li><li>Demonstrate the ability to complete the project.</li></ul><h2>Application procedures</h2><ol><li>Complete the Energy Efficient Homes Construction Loan <a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"2af07814-45ef-44e6-85e8-fafdba12e727\" href=\"/media/717\" title=\"Net Zero Application\">(Net Zero) Program paper application form. - DOCX - 41.68 KB</a></li><li>Review the list of <a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"b9bcbe1d-221d-428a-bd11-0906058c4800\" href=\"/media/604\" title=\"Net Zero Required Documents\">required documentation - PDF - 121.07 KB</a>​. The Department may ask for additional documents, if needed.</li><li>Submit the completed application by email to: <a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#4d00382139242b2c202421340823283f2a346329252e290d202c3f34212c2329632a223b\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"a0edd5ccd4c9c6c1cdc9ccd9e5cec5d2c7d98ec4c8c3c4e0cdc1d2d9ccc1cec48ec7cfd6\">[email protected]</span></a> and make sure to CC: <a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#95c1fdfaf8f4e6bbc2f4f9efd5f8f4e7ecf9f4fbf1bbf2fae3\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"4f1b2720222e3c61182e23350f222e3d36232e212b61282039\">[email protected]</span></a>.</li></ol><h2>Construction loan details</h2><p>The following table shows the available interest rates:</p><div class=\"maryland-table-container--scrollable\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"maryland-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><strong>HERS Score</strong></th><th scope=\"col\"><strong>Market rate​</strong></th><th scope=\"col\"><strong>More than 50% are at or below 60% of the Area Median Income (AMI)</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0-15</td><td>3%</td><td>2%</td></tr><tr><td>16-35</td><td>4%</td><td>3%</td></tr><tr><td>​36-50</td><td>5%</td><td>4%</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li><strong>Closing Fees:</strong><ul><li>Administration Fee: 1% of total loan</li><li>Appraisal Fee: $290 (subject to change)</li><li>Title Fees will be decided by and due to Title Company</li><li>Additional service fees may apply based on loan terms</li></ul></li><li><strong>Loan to Value (LTV):</strong><ul><li>Up to 90%</li></ul></li><li><strong>Loan Enhancement:</strong><ul><li>The​ Net Zero program can provide loan enhancements to applicants interested in securing a loan from a private lender.</li></ul></li><li>Terms of the construction loan include a typical 12 Month construction period and 12 month loan repayment period for projects that are for sale.</li></ul><p><strong>These are the rates and terms as of April 16, 2025​ and are subject to change.</strong></p><h2>Contact information</h2><p>Program Contact: Thomas Walz<br/>Email: <a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#c397abacaea2b0ed94a2afb983aea2b1baafa2ada7eda4acb5\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"b8ecd0d7d5d9cb96efd9d4c2f8d5d9cac1d4d9d6dc96dfd7ce\">[email protected]</span></a></p>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"automatic-list-995\" class=\"maryland-automatic-list\">\n<div class=\"maryland-card-group__header\">\n<div class=\"maryland-card-group__header-content\">\n<h2 class=\"maryland-card-group__title\" id=\"automatic-list-995\"><span>Latest energy news</span>\n</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maryland-card-group__more-link\">\n<a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"/news-stories\">\n          See all news\n        </a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><div class=\"views-element-container\" id=\"block-views-block-automatic-list-blocks-content-block-automatic-list-news\">\n<div><div class=\"js-view-dom-id-b24a9427e79dff949dc66291cd0b387ac5e8c1a983edc5defa7beaf5d35b9ea3\">\n<ul class=\"maryland-card-group\">\n<li class=\"maryland-card maryland-card--linked\" id=\"auto-list-item\">\n<a aria-label=\"&lt;span&gt;Public Hearing for Weatherization State Plan - Sep 15, 2026&lt;/span&gt;\n\" class=\"maryland-card__link\" href=\"/news-stories/public-notices/public-hearing-weatherization-state-plan-sep-15-2026\">\n<div class=\"maryland-card__container\">\n<div class=\"maryland-card__media\">\n<div class=\"maryland-card__img\">\n<picture>\n<source height=\"450\" media=\"all and (min-width: 500px)\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.maryland.gov/maryland-cms/prod/dhcd/s3fs-public/styles/4_3_500x375_focal_point_webp/public/images/2026-06/dhcd-public-notice-2026.jpg.webp?versionId=vcLBvg38IU7fjoUxBiApolhLrok.HzkB&amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEHgaCXVzLWVhc3QtMSJHMEUCIAs91ibUre4l9P%2BdU0Cprz/avdy1ucDILV4vAq7fxbAWAiEA4sDKzxhVeRtKVzQ5qAJYqNtoCHYnqCdtdt14vdJJpAoqugUIQBAAGgw3MTYwNjc2Njc5NDIiDJwO85CTgt/RPQSXEiqXBWYbWymiBJgqp4D8Hnz4XnCPh%2BRICtXzpe00RL0aRdjj3AbAbVy0ldMPpTTFvIlgYRKbojmo/Sq2wDwOK7CLU02vg6/LVyF2PGSVMJDrD/sMv%2BsfDYk56r9k4pLijyObEQx3q5P5OMcy1VJVRaXn7N0chX%2BQPOHX3a3Zg2znTX1qpppBW7DgAU